Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 15:33:53 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 317/638] cef: expose Chrome permission prompt factory

Apply CEF's upstream chrome_browser_permission_prompt patch as a discrete prerequisite for CEF permission UI interception.

AI_PHASE: chromium-cef-bootstrap

AI_STATUS: upstream-permission-prompt-prerequisite-applied

AI_ASSUMPTION: CEF 52dac911 patch stack is authoritative for Chromium 124.0.6367.0 integration

AI_VALIDATION: build 16 reported missing SetCreatePermissionPromptFunction

AI_EVIDENCE: test-artifacts/-cef-bootstrap-20260724/16-libcef-static-after-blink-devtools.log

AI_DECISION_CHAIN:; 52dac911; 788896bd50
